# {{ projectTitle }}: guide for contributors and AI assistants

Requirement keywords **MUST**, **MUST NOT**, **SHOULD** and **MAY** follow RFC 2119.
Read `MEDHA_STYLE.md` before changing anything visible.

## What this project is

A React 19 + TypeScript single-page app built with Vite, styled with the **Medha theme**
(Bootstrap 5.0). It was generated by medha-starter; `medha.json` records the stack.

| Route | What it is |
| --- | --- |
| `/`, `/about`, `/services`, `/gallery`, `/contact` | Public website (landing page and info pages) |
| `/login`, `/register` | Sign-in and registration (demo forms, no real authentication) |
| `/dashboard` | Dashboard in the Medha workspace layout |
| `/dashboard/components` | Component explorer: every Medha page in tabs by section |
| `/dashboard/<name>` | One page per Medha component (see `src/medha/CATALOG.md`) |
| `/404`, `/500`, anything unknown | Error pages |

