## Project structure

- `src/App.tsx`: every route. Add new routes here.
- `src/pages/`: your own pages. `ComponentExplorerPage.tsx` is an example of a page built from
  the Medha components.
- `src/components/medha/`: typed, reusable Medha building blocks (see below). Import them from
  `./components/medha`.
- `src/medha/`: the Medha theme ported to React. `pages/` has one component per theme page,
  `chrome/` the sidebar, topbar and website header/footer, `scripts/` the theme's own scripts,
  `styles/` its CSS. `CATALOG.md` lists every page with its route and file.
- `src/styles/app.css`: styles for your own screens.
- `public/medha/`: logo, fonts, equation-editor embed.

## Components

| Component | Use it for |
| --- | --- |
| `AppShell` | Every workspace page: sidebar, topbar (`title` is the breadcrumb), footer |
| `SiteShell` | Public website pages: top bar, navigation bar, footer |
| `AuthShell` | Sign-in, registration and error pages: centred card |
| `PageHeading` | The heading block at the top of a workspace page (eyebrow, title, description, actions) |
| `Panel` | A white card holding one section of a page |
| `MetricCard` | A dashboard figure with label, icon, value and caption |
| `Icon` | An icon from the Medha library; names are typed (`src/medha/icons.ts`) |
| `MedhaLogo` | The logo; the only way to show it |

For anything else (tables, forms, badges, tabs, modals, timelines, calendars), open the matching
page in the component explorer, find it in `src/medha/pages/`, and copy its markup into your
component. Keep the class names: they carry the Medha style.

## Rules

- New pages **MUST** use `AppShell`, `SiteShell` or `AuthShell`, live in `src/pages/` and be
  registered in `src/App.tsx`. Workspace pages **SHOULD** use a `/dashboard/...` path and get a
  link in `src/medha/chrome/Sidebar.tsx`.
- Code **MUST** be TypeScript (`.ts`/`.tsx`) with explicit prop types; `any` **MUST NOT** be used.
- Colours **MUST** come from the `--medha-*` tokens or the theme's classes. Hard-coded colours,
  other UI kits (Tailwind, MUI, Ant Design, Chakra, …) and new icon fonts **MUST NOT** be added.
- The logo **MUST** be shown through `<MedhaLogo />`.
- Files in `src/medha/scripts/` are the theme's own scripts, kept unchanged; **SHOULD NOT** be
  edited. Interactive behaviour in new code **MUST** be written as React state and handlers,
  not by querying the DOM.
- The sign-in and registration pages perform no authentication. Real authentication **MUST**
  happen on a server; never store passwords or tokens in `localStorage`.
- Before reporting work as done, `{{ runScript }} lint`, `{{ runScript }} typecheck`,
  `{{ runScript }} check:style`, `{{ runScript }} test` (if present) and `{{ runScript }} build`
  **MUST** pass. Report only results you actually observed.

